### Test User Integration APIs - Simplified Version

### 1. Test connection to UserService
GET https://localhost:7015/api/UserIntegration/test-connection
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get user info from UserService via RentalPaymentService
GET https://localhost:7015/api/UserIntegration/user-info
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Direct test on UserService (for comparison)

### 3. Get user info directly from UserService
GET https://localhost:7105/api/User/info
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Multiple calls to test consistency

### 4. Test again - RentalPaymentService calling UserService
GET https://localhost:7015/api/UserIntegration/user-info
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Test again - Direct call to UserService
GET https://localhost:7105/api/User/info
Content-Type: application/json
